WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 12=

5
01:40.780 --> 01:42.860
Do you have a wife back home?

6
01:44.220 --> 01:44.860
Your Majesty,

7
01:45.500 --> 01:45.940
I do not.

8
01:47.030 --> 01:47.910
What do you think

9
01:49.190 --> 01:50.940
of my daughter, Princess Danyang?

10
02:00.910 --> 02:01.500
I dare not presume

11
02:01.940 --> 02:03.110
to comment on Her Highness.

12
02:03.940 --> 02:04.910
Let's leave it at that.

13
02:07.190 --> 02:08.460
I'd like to play matchmaker

14
02:09.390 --> 02:11.420
and offer Princess Danyang your hand in marriage.

15
02:11.860 --> 02:12.420
What do you say?

16
02:22.620 --> 02:23.700
I wouldn't dare deceive Your Majesty.

17
02:27.230 --> 02:28.180
As it happens,

18
02:28.580 --> 02:29.390
one of my students

19
02:30.020 --> 02:31.900
has long admired Princess Danyang, too.

20
02:32.510 --> 02:33.390
Which student?

21
02:33.700 --> 02:37.350
Wei Shu, the Top Scholar Your Majesty appointed.

22
02:39.830 --> 02:41.399
If he admires the Princess,

23
02:41.441 --> 02:43.011
why didn't he speak up earlier?

24
02:45.860 --> 02:46.860
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

25
02:47.460 --> 02:50.110
Is your family the noble Wei clan?

26
02:51.900 --> 02:52.270
Yes.

27
02:52.860 --> 02:55.860
They say great families are hard to fathom.

28
02:57.460 --> 02:58.510
I won't

29
02:59.510 --> 03:01.020
send Wanyao into one.

30
03:02.460 --> 03:03.020
Rise.

31
03:04.140 --> 03:04.950
Take your seats.

32
03:05.460 --> 03:06.180
Thank you, Your Majesty.

33
03:06.420 --> 03:07.070
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34
03:15.670 --> 03:16.110
Your Majesty,

35
03:16.900 --> 03:19.460
(General Yu arrives!)

36
03:25.300 --> 03:31.300
(Lanyue Hall)

37
03:36.830 --> 03:39.180
You're hosting the realm's finest talents.

38
03:39.620 --> 03:41.900
Why wasn't I invited, Your Majesty?

39
03:42.950 --> 03:44.390
You've had your hands full.

40
03:44.670 --> 03:46.990
I didn't want to trouble you.

41
03:53.670 --> 03:56.350
I merely lighten Your Majesty's load.

42
03:56.790 --> 03:57.830
That hardly keeps me busy.

43
04:15.270 --> 04:16.030
Yuhan wine.

44
04:16.990 --> 04:18.030
A fine vintage from North Jing.

45
04:20.150 --> 04:21.180
Speaking of which,

46
04:22.990 --> 04:25.940
tribute wine from there has grown scarce in recent years.

47
04:27.620 --> 04:27.990
Your Majesty,

48
04:29.470 --> 04:32.670
do you recall the customs of the North Jing region?

49
04:34.350 --> 04:35.350
When a father or elder brother dies,

50
04:35.790 --> 04:36.910
his son or younger brother succeeds him.

51
04:38.180 --> 04:39.860
Though General Meng Baiyu has died,

52
04:40.350 --> 04:42.940
his successor is still of the Meng clan.

53
04:43.300 --> 04:43.620
So,

54
04:44.380 --> 04:45.180
I believe,

55
04:45.790 --> 04:47.420
Princess Danyang should marry

56
04:47.590 --> 04:50.110
neither the Top Scholar nor the Third-Place Scholar,

57
04:52.500 --> 04:52.990
but

58
04:53.500 --> 04:55.710
Young General Meng, the current military governor.

59
05:04.710 --> 05:05.260
Lord Yu,

60
05:06.300 --> 05:07.500
I'm a princess of Huai.

61
05:09.110 --> 05:11.030
Precisely because you're a princess of Huai,

62
05:11.350 --> 05:14.470
you should put the people first.

63
05:15.470 --> 05:16.030
North Jing

64
05:16.500 --> 05:17.470
is far from stable.

65
05:25.620 --> 05:26.420
Lord Yu,

66
05:27.260 --> 05:30.230
we'll find another way to secure North Jing.

67
05:31.740 --> 05:34.030
But when it comes to their marriage,

68
05:34.550 --> 05:35.940
we elders

69
05:36.500 --> 05:38.030
shouldn't force their hand.

70
05:38.300 --> 05:40.260
We should ask what they want.

71
05:43.230 --> 05:43.910
Third-Place Scholar.

72
05:46.420 --> 05:46.940
Your Majesty.

73
05:47.590 --> 05:49.860
I'm offering you my daughter's hand in marriage.

74
05:50.060 --> 05:50.940
Will you accept?

75
06:00.110 --> 06:00.710
Your Majesty,

76
06:01.550 --> 06:01.910
I will

77
06:02.670 --> 06:03.150
accept.

78
06:03.690 --> 06:08.300
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

79
06:09.790 --> 06:10.470
(Yan Shang,)

80
06:10.860 --> 06:12.230
(at least you've got some backbone.)

81
06:13.300 --> 06:14.260
But I won't accept it.

82
06:14.560 --> 06:17.760
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

83
06:19.590 --> 06:20.180
Wanyao.

84
06:21.230 --> 06:22.639
You just asked what I wanted.

85
06:22.680 --> 06:24.055
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

86
06:24.580 --> 06:24.940
I won't marry him.

87
06:24.989 --> 06:28.081
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

88
06:28.123 --> 06:29.813
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

89
06:33.060 --> 06:35.380
Princess Danyang knows her duty to the realm.

90
06:35.710 --> 06:36.180
Good!

91
06:37.470 --> 06:37.860
Your Majesty,

92
06:39.790 --> 06:40.420
I congratulate you!

93
07:04.060 --> 07:04.590
Your Highness.

94
07:12.820 --> 07:13.550
Right now,

95
07:13.990 --> 07:15.420
the man who pleases her most

96
07:16.420 --> 07:17.910
is Yan Shang.

97
07:19.620 --> 07:21.590
Mr. Wei is probably too shy,

98
07:21.790 --> 07:24.030
unlike that bold third-place scholar.

99
07:24.230 --> 07:25.500
What third-place scholar?

100
07:26.300 --> 07:27.470
So affected and coy,

101
07:27.790 --> 07:28.790
with flirtatious eyes.

102
07:29.260 --> 07:30.710
He looks like a shameless rake.

103
07:31.420 --> 07:33.230
He couldn't even outscore Wei Shu.

104
07:34.710 --> 07:36.550
With that fox around,

105
07:37.470 --> 07:39.500
it's really unfair to Wei Shu.

106
07:40.060 --> 07:41.030
Exactly.

107
07:41.350 --> 07:43.060
We'll never understand

108
07:43.470 --> 07:45.470
these princesses' tastes.

109
07:57.230 --> 07:57.710
Your Highness,

110
07:58.380 --> 07:59.470
His Majesty arranged that marriage

111
07:59.710 --> 08:00.470
to help you.

112
08:01.500 --> 08:03.350
I know my father better than you do.

113
08:04.300 --> 08:05.500
A marriage would keep you

114
08:05.860 --> 08:07.030
from having to head north again.

115
08:07.470 --> 08:07.910
Yan Shang.

116
08:08.620 --> 08:09.420
Have you forgotten

117
08:09.910 --> 08:11.790
why I kept you by my side

118
08:12.110 --> 08:12.790
as my adviser?

119
08:13.590 --> 08:15.060
Have you forgotten what I'm fighting for?

120
08:15.790 --> 08:16.710
When have I ever

121
08:17.060 --> 08:18.110
sought safety for myself?

122
08:18.180 --> 08:19.110
I haven't forgotten.

123
08:19.500 --> 08:20.670
That's why I came to tell you.

124
08:21.060 --> 08:21.670
Even if...

125
08:24.860 --> 08:26.230
Even if there's no love between us,

126
08:26.710 --> 08:27.820
we can pretend there is.

127
08:28.350 --> 08:28.740
In private,

128
08:29.300 --> 08:30.420
I'll still be your right-hand man.

129
08:31.230 --> 08:31.710
In public,

130
08:32.380 --> 08:33.740
we'd just play the loving couple.

131
08:34.710 --> 08:35.860
It's only a temporary fix.

132
08:36.310 --> 08:36.830
I won't pretend.

133
08:39.110 --> 08:39.839
If the Central Circuit

134
08:39.881 --> 08:41.491
comes demanding that marriage one day,

135
08:42.500 --> 08:43.660
at least we could hold them off.

136
08:43.900 --> 08:44.830
Yan Shang, listen carefully.

137
08:45.590 --> 08:47.710
I'm tired of being married off like a pawn.

138
08:48.230 --> 08:49.990
Tired of having no choice but to compromise.

139
08:50.070 --> 08:51.590
I won't stand for it anymore.

140
08:52.740 --> 08:52.990
Your Highness...

141
09:06.430 --> 09:07.740
Mu Wanyao, stop!

142
09:07.950 --> 09:08.990
Mr. Yang, don't!

143
09:13.520 --> 09:14.140
(Cui Family Residence)

144
09:16.020 --> 09:16.500
Wanyao!

145
09:19.900 --> 09:20.990
Were you trying to kill yourself

146
09:21.350 --> 09:22.110
or take me down with you?

147
09:23.380 --> 09:24.470
If you won't marry Yan Shang,

148
09:25.110 --> 09:25.740
why not marry me instead?

149
09:26.590 --> 09:27.660
Why turn us all down so flatly?

150
09:28.070 --> 09:29.860
Yang Si, who do you think you are?

151
09:30.900 --> 09:32.740
Can you stop Yu Cheng'an or Meng Zaishi?

152
09:33.500 --> 09:35.140
If Yu Cheng'an was just messing around today,

153
09:35.350 --> 09:36.350
I won't have to marry anyone.

154
09:37.470 --> 09:38.950
But if he really wants to send me north,

155
09:39.540 --> 09:41.599
Yan Shang, you, and Wei Shu

156
09:41.641 --> 09:43.091
all marrying me together

157
09:43.310 --> 09:44.110
could not save me.

158
09:46.020 --> 09:46.620
When that happens,

159
09:47.070 --> 09:48.860
whoever becomes my consort is as good as dead.

160
09:55.860 --> 09:56.409
Wanyao...

161
09:56.451 --> 09:57.251
Go home to shed your tears.

162
09:57.430 --> 09:58.110
I'm not dead yet.

163
09:58.660 --> 09:59.070
Get lost, too!

164
10:08.070 --> 10:09.230
What does she mean, "too"?

165
10:14.620 --> 10:14.990
Yan Shang.

166
10:16.350 --> 10:16.780
Wei Shu.

167
10:17.380 --> 10:18.110
Has the Imperial Uncle left?

168
10:20.140 --> 10:20.590
Yan Shang,

169
10:21.350 --> 10:23.830
why did Lord Yu suddenly say all that?

170
10:24.500 --> 10:26.740
Does he really intend to send Her Highness north?

171
10:28.350 --> 10:29.990
North Jing has been quiet lately

172
10:30.380 --> 10:31.830
and at peace with the court for years.

173
10:32.310 --> 10:33.260
Yu Cheng'an was probably

174
10:33.740 --> 10:34.860
just speaking offhand.

175
10:35.020 --> 10:36.070
(Finally, the exams are over.)

176
10:36.140 --> 10:37.540
- (What a relief!) - (You said it!)

177
10:37.660 --> 10:38.209
(Let's check over there.)

178
10:38.251 --> 10:38.921
(Come on, let's look this way.)

179
10:39.500 --> 10:40.430
Other people's lives,

180
10:40.710 --> 10:41.620
other people's futures,

181
10:42.070 --> 10:43.590
mean nothing to him.

182
10:44.140 --> 10:45.380
So he jokes about them so casually.

183
10:46.140 --> 10:46.710
Or perhaps,

184
10:47.500 --> 10:48.990
he just meant to give the Princess a warning

185
10:49.230 --> 10:49.860
and scare her.

186
10:50.230 --> 10:51.190
If this villain isn't eliminated,

187
10:51.830 --> 10:52.620
the realm will never know peace.

188
10:53.590 --> 10:55.500
Say that to anyone else,

189
10:56.020 --> 10:56.990
and your family

190
10:57.620 --> 10:59.140
could be doomed by tomorrow.

191
11:03.660 --> 11:04.900
If you're right

192
11:05.590 --> 11:07.070
and Lord Yu was just trying to scare her,

193
11:07.430 --> 11:08.140
then Her Highness

194
11:08.620 --> 11:09.900
is safe only for now.

195
11:11.590 --> 11:12.140
Exactly.

196
11:12.860 --> 11:14.110
The political landscape can change overnight.

197
11:14.860 --> 11:15.710
The two military circuits in North Jing

198
11:16.660 --> 11:17.710
and the regional powers across the realm

199
11:18.190 --> 11:19.230
are poised to strike,

200
11:19.620 --> 11:20.380
all aimed at the Imperial Court.

201
11:21.660 --> 11:22.780
If the Central Circuit makes a move,

202
11:23.230 --> 11:23.710
the Princess

203
11:24.500 --> 11:25.830
will be the first sacrifice.

204
11:28.660 --> 11:29.110
Let's go.

205
11:29.780 --> 11:30.500
I need to go back

206
11:31.190 --> 11:32.070
and apologize to the Princess.

207
11:32.620 --> 11:33.020
What's wrong?

208
11:33.740 --> 11:34.500
I upset her again

209
11:35.540 --> 11:36.590
just now.

210
11:42.620 --> 11:43.830
I hear

211
11:46.110 --> 11:47.540
the new top scholar, Wei Shu,

212
11:49.070 --> 11:50.190
is your student.

213
11:50.540 --> 11:50.860
That's right.

214
11:52.070 --> 11:53.260
So why are you singing

215
11:53.900 --> 11:56.900
the third-place scholar's praises to me?

216
11:58.260 --> 11:59.190
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

217
12:00.310 --> 12:02.740
It's just that the third-place scholar

218
12:03.260 --> 12:04.230
is so charming.

219
12:04.660 --> 12:05.540
I couldn't help

220
12:05.950 --> 12:08.140
going on about him in front of you.

221
12:09.990 --> 12:11.260
Charming?

222
12:12.430 --> 12:14.990
That's not a word I'd expect to hear

223
12:15.950 --> 12:16.780
from you.

224
12:17.430 --> 12:18.950
Your Highness may not know this.

225
12:20.540 --> 12:22.140
That third-place scholar

226
12:22.230 --> 12:23.950
may not be the brightest,

227
12:24.710 --> 12:26.950
but his looks are second to none.

228
12:27.780 --> 12:28.590
I'd say

229
12:28.900 --> 12:31.380
he even outshines the men

230
12:31.950 --> 12:33.020
already by Your Highness's side.

231
12:47.380 --> 12:48.350
Who are those two?

232
12:54.310 --> 12:54.860
Your Highness,

233
12:55.620 --> 12:58.070
they're this year's top and third-ranked scholars.

234
13:00.710 --> 13:01.900
The one in white

235
13:02.140 --> 13:03.140
is handsome enough,

236
13:04.020 --> 13:05.470
but a bit too young.

237
13:06.140 --> 13:07.070
He's not my type.

238
13:10.260 --> 13:11.620
What's the name of the one in very pale cyan?

239
13:12.350 --> 13:12.740
Your Highness,

240
13:13.350 --> 13:15.260
that's Yan Shang, the third-place scholar.

241
13:19.070 --> 13:19.620
Your Highness,

242
13:20.310 --> 13:22.070
was I wrong?

243
13:23.710 --> 13:25.020
For a man of your age,

244
13:25.540 --> 13:26.190
you certainly have

245
13:26.740 --> 13:27.380
a good eye.

246
13:31.620 --> 13:32.780
Feng Xianyu,

247
13:34.110 --> 13:34.950
isn't it ironic?

248
13:36.710 --> 13:39.110
If you hadn't come to me that day

249
13:39.500 --> 13:42.190
and turned down fame and rank out of sheer pride,

250
13:42.950 --> 13:43.740
today,

251
13:44.430 --> 13:45.759
I wouldn't have seen

252
13:45.801 --> 13:48.041
such a handsome third-place scholar.

253
13:49.590 --> 13:50.590
So I suppose

254
13:51.190 --> 13:52.590
I owe you my thanks.

255
14:14.300 --> 14:16.940
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

256
14:51.110 --> 14:52.020
What's the rush?

257
14:52.260 --> 14:53.190
I have urgent news for Her Highness.

258
15:10.430 --> 15:11.020
Your Highness,

259
15:11.860 --> 15:12.620
Lord Yu requests an audience.

260
15:19.380 --> 15:25.660
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

261
15:29.460 --> 15:34.540
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

262
15:34.590 --> 15:36.990
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

263
15:37.160 --> 15:40.420
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

264
15:40.820 --> 15:43.890
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

265
15:44.260 --> 15:46.730
♪With sacrificed innocence...♪

266
15:47.470 --> 15:47.950
Your Highness.

267
15:49.190 --> 15:49.660
Your Highness,

268
15:50.310 --> 15:51.344
Yan Shang is still standing in the rain.

269
15:51.386 --> 15:54.513
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

270
15:54.555 --> 15:56.215
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

271
15:56.710 --> 15:57.479
Why are you standing

272
15:57.521 --> 15:58.561
outside my door like a statue?

273
15:58.950 --> 15:59.620
Say what you have to say.

274
16:01.110 --> 16:01.830
If it's nonsense,

275
16:02.140 --> 16:02.769
save your breath.

276
16:02.811 --> 16:05.599
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

277
16:05.641 --> 16:08.189
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers...♪

278
16:08.231 --> 16:09.711
I don't know where to begin.

279
16:10.380 --> 16:11.740
I'll wait until Your Highness returns

280
16:12.260 --> 16:12.714
and explain everything then.

281
16:12.756 --> 16:16.502
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

282
16:16.544 --> 16:19.591
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

283
16:19.633 --> 16:24.203
♪I'll guard my princess, and keep her tears at bay♪

284
16:56.660 --> 16:57.140
Your Highness,

285
16:57.950 --> 16:58.860
I don't understand.

286
16:59.140 --> 17:01.020
Why are you so angry with him?

287
17:03.860 --> 17:04.910
I'm not angry with him.

288
17:05.950 --> 17:06.910
The road ahead is dangerous,

289
17:07.230 --> 17:08.150
and our chances are slim.

290
17:09.500 --> 17:10.630
I just wanted to tell him

291
17:11.740 --> 17:13.300
not to get his hopes up.

292
17:14.780 --> 17:15.710
And remind myself, too.

293
17:21.910 --> 17:23.780
A handwritten letter from General Meng Zaishi,

294
17:23.950 --> 17:25.990
the new military governor of the Central Circuit,

295
17:27.910 --> 17:29.870
has just arrived in Sheng'an.

296
17:30.740 --> 17:31.060
Your Highness,

297
17:31.820 --> 17:34.300
did you know him when you were in the north?

298
17:35.910 --> 17:36.670
Not really.

299
17:38.950 --> 17:40.100
That's odd.

300
17:40.870 --> 17:43.430
General Meng is already twenty-three

301
17:44.060 --> 17:45.020
and still unmarried.

302
17:45.910 --> 17:46.910
That's rare enough.

303
17:47.580 --> 17:50.020
Yet in his letter, he didn't ask the Court

304
17:51.150 --> 17:52.230
to arrange a marriage for him.

305
17:52.670 --> 17:56.100
Instead, he asked after you several times.

306
18:00.340 --> 18:00.780
Read it.

307
18:05.990 --> 18:07.820
As military governor of the Central Circuit,

308
18:08.260 --> 18:09.470
General Meng must have included

309
18:10.100 --> 18:11.780
important matters of state in his letter.

310
18:12.740 --> 18:14.340
I'm just an ignorant woman.

311
18:16.910 --> 18:17.580
I wouldn't dare read it.

312
18:21.910 --> 18:23.230
Forgive me. I spoke out of turn.

313
18:25.470 --> 18:26.430
In that case,

314
18:28.100 --> 18:29.470
I'll just read

315
18:30.100 --> 18:32.670
a few lines to Your Highness.

316
18:33.430 --> 18:34.340
He's nothing more than

317
18:34.670 --> 18:35.430
a stranger to me.

318
18:36.670 --> 18:37.670
I don't care

319
18:38.390 --> 18:39.060
what his letter says.

320
18:44.060 --> 18:44.580
True.

321
18:47.340 --> 18:48.020
But...

322
18:48.910 --> 18:52.710
what if General Meng wants you to marry into North Jing again?

323
19:02.100 --> 19:03.390
I'm a princess of Huai.

324
19:04.340 --> 19:06.470
It's my duty to ease the court's burdens.

325
19:07.470 --> 19:09.540
Besides, I've been married there once.

326
19:10.100 --> 19:11.020
There's no need to make a fuss.

327
19:13.740 --> 19:14.470
How sensible.

328
19:16.300 --> 19:18.190
Since returning from North Jing,

329
19:18.430 --> 19:20.780
Your Highness has grown much more composed.

330
19:21.150 --> 19:21.740
Impressive.

331
19:22.780 --> 19:23.430
Indeed.

332
19:24.260 --> 19:26.870
Some people lose their lives

333
19:27.260 --> 19:29.870
because they don't know the ways of the world.

334
19:32.230 --> 19:32.990
Actually,

335
19:33.540 --> 19:34.820
there's nothing urgent today.

336
19:35.540 --> 19:37.580
I was just curious.

337
19:38.150 --> 19:39.020
What exactly

338
19:40.020 --> 19:42.740
did you do in North Jing

339
19:43.150 --> 19:45.990
to make General Meng so taken with you?

340
19:54.100 --> 19:54.910
On second thought,

341
19:55.340 --> 19:55.950
there's no need to ask.

342
20:01.950 --> 20:03.500
Your Highness, please return.

343
20:11.430 --> 20:12.630
If General Meng

344
20:13.230 --> 20:14.910
really asks for your hand,

345
20:15.260 --> 20:17.390
it would help Huai

346
20:17.630 --> 20:18.780
keep the regional powers in check.

347
20:31.820 --> 20:36.090
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

348
20:36.140 --> 20:39.530
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

349
20:39.580 --> 20:45.520
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

350
20:46.090 --> 20:49.930
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

351
20:49.980 --> 20:53.300
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

352
20:53.350 --> 20:57.440
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

353
21:11.740 --> 21:12.340
(Yu Cheng'an,)

354
21:13.780 --> 21:14.820
(this time, let's see)

355
21:16.740 --> 21:18.390
(will you kill me again,)

356
21:19.870 --> 21:21.430
(or will I kill you first?)

357
21:40.380 --> 21:44.420
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

358
21:54.670 --> 21:55.100
Your Highness.

359
21:57.060 --> 21:58.020
Third-Place Scholar,

360
21:58.740 --> 21:59.580
you know me?

361
22:00.060 --> 22:01.100
As a grand princess,

362
22:01.780 --> 22:03.540
who in Sheng'an doesn't?

363
22:05.100 --> 22:06.150
What a smooth talker.

364
22:07.340 --> 22:08.910
Come here. I have questions for you.

365
22:20.230 --> 22:20.950
Go ahead, Your Highness.

366
22:33.500 --> 22:34.580
Why are you backing away?

367
22:38.780 --> 22:39.540
Your Highness is a noble princess,

368
22:40.100 --> 22:40.990
while I'm just a common scholar.

369
22:41.580 --> 22:43.580
I'll stay here and hear you out.

370
22:45.540 --> 22:46.580
Oh, you haven't been appointed yet.

371
22:47.780 --> 22:48.670
No need to rush.

372
22:49.780 --> 22:51.710
Once we've had a proper chat,

373
22:52.190 --> 22:54.500
you won't have to worry about that anymore.

374
22:55.670 --> 22:56.390
I appreciate

375
22:56.910 --> 22:57.870
Your Highness's kindness.

376
23:02.100 --> 23:03.190
Speaking of which,

377
23:04.020 --> 23:06.260
I've suddenly taken an interest in history.

378
23:07.500 --> 23:08.340
However,

379
23:08.710 --> 23:09.990
there's a lot I don't understand.

380
23:12.020 --> 23:13.870
As a third-place scholar, you must be well-read.

381
23:14.670 --> 23:17.230
Come to my residence and enlighten me.

382
23:22.540 --> 23:23.340
Forgive me, Your Highness.

383
23:24.260 --> 23:25.260
I'm just a country bumpkin

384
23:25.870 --> 23:26.740
with little talent or learning.

385
23:27.020 --> 23:27.740
I only passed the exam by luck.

386
23:28.580 --> 23:29.100
I'm afraid

387
23:29.950 --> 23:30.540
I'm not up to the task.

388
23:31.710 --> 23:32.150
I must take my leave.

389
23:34.820 --> 23:36.500
You've moved right next door to Princess Danyang,

390
23:37.020 --> 23:38.580
so I thought you knew how to play your cards.

391
23:39.670 --> 23:40.430
Turns out

392
23:41.150 --> 23:42.300
you're stubborn to the end.

393
23:43.820 --> 23:44.500
What,

394
23:45.100 --> 23:46.630
are you staying chaste for her?

395
23:50.740 --> 23:51.580
You're teasing me, Your Highness.

396
24:23.950 --> 24:24.740
When we get back,

397
24:25.020 --> 24:26.300
if Yan Shang is still waiting outside,

398
24:26.710 --> 24:27.470
let him in.

399
24:28.430 --> 24:29.390
Have you forgiven him?

400
24:30.060 --> 24:31.150
There's nothing to forgive.

401
24:32.300 --> 24:33.340
Keeping my distance for a few days

402
24:33.820 --> 24:34.500
will be better for us both.

403
24:36.630 --> 24:38.190
Then I'll invite him in

404
24:38.580 --> 24:40.150
and make some ginger tea to warm him up.

405
24:45.390 --> 24:46.780
(Peaceful days like this)

406
24:47.950 --> 24:49.020
(may be numbered.)

407
24:50.740 --> 24:52.020
(If my plans fail and I die,)

408
24:53.230 --> 24:53.710
(Yan Shang,)

409
24:54.820 --> 24:55.990
(how long will you remember me?)

410
25:03.990 --> 25:04.780
Careful, Your Highness.

411
25:13.740 --> 25:14.870
Isn't this the umbrella you gave him?

412
25:15.260 --> 25:15.990
Why did he leave it here?

413
25:19.430 --> 25:20.100
Here, Your Highness.

414
25:27.470 --> 25:27.910
Your Highness!

415
25:31.670 --> 25:32.190
Wei Shu?

416
25:32.740 --> 25:33.390
What brings you here?

417
25:33.630 --> 25:34.060
Your Highness,

418
25:34.470 --> 25:35.710
do you know where Yan Shang went?

419
25:36.230 --> 25:37.150
I'm worried about him.

420
25:37.470 --> 25:38.630
What's there to worry about?

421
25:39.390 --> 25:41.100
He was supposed to study with me tonight.

422
25:41.870 --> 25:43.239
I waited outside his house for ages,

423
25:43.281 --> 25:44.081
but he never came back.

424
25:44.670 --> 25:45.740
He never misses an appointment.

425
25:45.990 --> 25:47.060
He's not one to break his word.

426
25:47.500 --> 25:48.100
You're right.

427
25:50.150 --> 25:51.020
He never breaks his promises.

428
25:58.780 --> 25:59.580
(Where could he have gone?)

429
26:00.230 --> 26:01.020
(Who summoned him?)

430
26:02.190 --> 26:02.580
(Or...)

431
26:03.100 --> 26:04.020
(who took him away?)

432
26:05.190 --> 26:05.910
(Yu Cheng'an?)

433
26:06.630 --> 26:07.340
(Li Zhi?)

434
26:08.060 --> 26:08.740
(Or Father?)

435
26:27.060 --> 26:28.060
You may all leave.

436
26:29.100 --> 26:31.670
Don't disturb me tonight.

437
26:50.820 --> 26:51.820
Yan Shang is clever.

438
26:52.150 --> 26:53.260
He should be fine.

439
26:53.820 --> 26:55.190
That depends on who's holding him

440
26:56.060 --> 26:56.820
and what trouble he's in.

441
27:06.100 --> 27:06.580
Your Highness.

442
27:07.740 --> 27:08.190
Found him?

443
27:08.540 --> 27:09.580
We've asked around.

444
27:09.870 --> 27:11.020
No one has seen Yan Shang.

445
27:13.910 --> 27:14.780
He's new to Sheng'an

446
27:15.260 --> 27:16.390
and barely knows anyone here.

447
27:18.060 --> 27:19.340
Who would want to harm him?

448
27:20.710 --> 27:21.580
Have you checked the Crown Prince's place?

449
27:21.910 --> 27:22.470
I'll go now.

450
27:22.870 --> 27:23.390
Who's there?

451
27:23.710 --> 27:24.500
Who dares throw stones

452
27:24.630 --> 27:25.990
into the Princess's residence?

453
27:28.190 --> 27:28.820
Your Highness, look.

454
27:29.260 --> 27:30.710
There's a note wrapped around the stone.

455
27:32.340 --> 27:34.740
("He's at Xiangfeng Tower.")

456
27:38.950 --> 27:39.390
Fang Tong,

457
27:40.300 --> 27:40.950
gather the men.

458
27:41.430 --> 27:41.870
Come with me.

459
27:42.100 --> 27:43.100
Your Highness, where to?

460
27:44.100 --> 27:45.020
Grand Princess Luling's residence.

461
27:45.580 --> 27:46.150
Xiangfeng Tower.

462
27:48.020 --> 27:48.340
Understood.

463
27:53.740 --> 27:54.060
Your Highness, please.

464
27:54.260 --> 27:54.990
The carriage is too slow.

465
27:56.710 --> 27:57.100
Get down.

466
28:03.300 --> 28:04.630
Fang Tong, take the carriage.

467
28:04.870 --> 28:05.540
He can't ride.

468
28:28.990 --> 28:29.910
Third-Place Scholar,

469
28:33.020 --> 28:34.580
when you wake up,

470
28:35.630 --> 28:36.950
will you thank me

471
28:37.990 --> 28:39.340
or try to kill yourself?

472
28:40.540 --> 28:42.060
At least lying in my bed

473
28:42.990 --> 28:44.849
beats standing outside Wanyao's door

474
28:44.891 --> 28:46.171
in the cold rain.

475
28:46.950 --> 28:47.630
Besides,

476
28:49.060 --> 28:50.500
she can't even look after herself,

477
28:51.020 --> 28:53.430
yet she's playing at keeping pets.

478
28:53.740 --> 28:55.020
(Your Highness, Princess Danyang is here.)

479
28:55.230 --> 28:56.230
(She says she's lost a cat.)

480
28:56.710 --> 28:58.020
(She saw it run in here.)

481
29:01.950 --> 29:03.710
Then show her to the flower hall.

482
29:03.990 --> 29:04.910
Make her comfortable.

483
29:05.190 --> 29:06.060
Let her wait!

484
29:07.020 --> 29:07.300
(Got it.)

485
29:11.630 --> 29:12.169
Meow, meow!

486
29:12.211 --> 29:12.809
(Your Highness, please return!)

487
29:12.851 --> 29:13.334
Come out, kitty!

488
29:13.376 --> 29:13.987
(Your Highness, please return!)

489
29:14.029 --> 29:14.669
- Meow, meow! - (Your Highness, please return!)

490
29:15.020 --> 29:15.340
(Your Highness...)

491
29:15.870 --> 29:16.580
- Wanyao! - (Your Highness, please return!)

492
29:17.020 --> 29:18.020
What's all this fuss?

493
29:22.230 --> 29:23.020
Forgive me, Aunt.

494
29:23.780 --> 29:25.300
I didn't mean to disturb your retreat.

495
29:25.740 --> 29:27.870
But that cat means the world to me.

496
29:28.780 --> 29:31.300
He's always by my side.

497
29:31.580 --> 29:32.670
I can't bear to be without him.

498
29:33.870 --> 29:35.820
He happened to run into your residence today.

499
29:36.670 --> 29:37.500
So please,

500
29:37.870 --> 29:39.150
don't punish him.

501
29:39.540 --> 29:40.580
Why would I punish him?

502
29:41.990 --> 29:44.260
Would I really quarrel with an animal?

503
29:44.740 --> 29:47.020
And please, don't blame me either.

504
29:47.580 --> 29:49.580
I'll leave as soon as I find him.

505
29:50.710 --> 29:51.390
But

506
29:52.020 --> 29:52.740
I'll take back

507
29:53.820 --> 29:54.780
what's mine.

508
30:07.740 --> 30:08.430
Please, Aunt,

509
30:08.870 --> 30:09.780
let me search your residence.

510
31:38.740 --> 31:39.300
Your Highness...

511
31:57.340 --> 31:58.390
Take your time.

512
31:59.340 --> 32:00.580
I have no time for this.

513
32:04.780 --> 32:05.060
You...

514
32:10.100 --> 32:10.500
Yan Shang!

515
32:13.020 --> 32:13.470
Yan Shang!

516
32:18.100 --> 32:18.910
How strange.

517
32:19.390 --> 32:20.540
What is he doing here?

518
32:21.150 --> 32:22.910
Ask him yourself.

519
32:23.430 --> 32:23.870
Fine.

520
32:24.430 --> 32:25.150
I'll ask him

521
32:25.630 --> 32:26.470
when he wakes up.

522
32:27.670 --> 32:28.060
Let's go.

523
32:28.390 --> 32:28.870
Stop!

524
32:28.990 --> 32:29.740
Guards!

525
32:34.020 --> 32:34.950
Don't mind me.

526
32:35.150 --> 32:35.430
Shut up!

527
32:36.390 --> 32:36.990
Wanyao,

528
32:38.430 --> 32:39.910
stop playing dumb.

529
32:41.260 --> 32:42.780
Let's be frank.

530
32:43.260 --> 32:43.910
This man

531
32:44.300 --> 32:45.430
should count himself lucky

532
32:46.150 --> 32:47.500
that I'd even fancy him.

533
32:49.430 --> 32:51.540
You and I really do share

534
32:51.950 --> 32:52.710
the same taste.

535
32:53.470 --> 32:54.870
I happen to like him, too.

536
32:55.670 --> 32:56.910
To have us both fall for him,

537
32:57.300 --> 32:58.470
he's a lucky man indeed.

538
33:00.020 --> 33:00.820
So please, Aunt,

539
33:01.950 --> 33:02.780
let me take him away.

540
33:05.470 --> 33:06.190
Wanyao,

541
33:07.390 --> 33:09.390
you've spent too long in North Jing

542
33:09.780 --> 33:12.260
and forgotten your place here.

543
33:14.300 --> 33:15.740
You can remain in Sheng'an

544
33:16.300 --> 33:18.190
only at others' mercy!

545
33:20.190 --> 33:21.060
Thanks for the reminder.

546
33:22.670 --> 33:23.670
I know my place.

547
33:23.950 --> 33:25.150
Then leave him here

548
33:25.430 --> 33:27.300
and go home quietly.

549
33:27.670 --> 33:30.430
I'll forgive a young fool who doesn't know any better.

550
33:31.340 --> 33:32.820
But mark my words.

551
33:33.390 --> 33:34.340
Even if

552
33:35.300 --> 33:36.390
you take him today,

553
33:37.150 --> 33:37.710
tomorrow,

554
33:38.470 --> 33:39.910
one word from me,

555
33:40.670 --> 33:42.020
and my agents

556
33:42.390 --> 33:43.540
will come to your door

557
33:44.020 --> 33:45.340
and bring him back to me.

558
33:45.740 --> 33:46.950
There's nothing you can do.

559
33:58.630 --> 33:59.260
What are you doing?

560
33:59.740 --> 34:00.870
This is my residence!

561
34:01.230 --> 34:02.060
Have you gone mad?

562
34:02.710 --> 34:03.500
You're right, Aunt.

563
34:04.540 --> 34:05.340
I have nothing.

564
34:05.990 --> 34:06.870
I am nothing.

565
34:07.430 --> 34:08.310
I can't ask for anything.

566
34:09.870 --> 34:10.830
And I can't take him away.

567
34:11.700 --> 34:12.180
So,

568
34:12.830 --> 34:13.470
I don't want him anymore.

569
34:14.540 --> 34:15.660
I might as well kill him.

570
34:17.140 --> 34:18.750
I'll kill him here today.

571
34:19.390 --> 34:19.910
Tomorrow,

572
34:20.500 --> 34:22.430
I'll go beg Father to forgive me.

573
34:23.390 --> 34:25.990
Blame the Third-Place Scholar's bad luck.

574
34:27.270 --> 34:28.830
I'll borrow your fine residence

575
34:29.620 --> 34:31.830
to dispose of this pretty troublemaker.

576
34:33.540 --> 34:33.950
Stop!

577
34:42.580 --> 34:43.140
Out of the way!

578
34:43.790 --> 34:44.430
Let them go!

579
34:51.540 --> 34:51.910
You...

580
34:56.060 --> 34:57.750
You can't commit such a crime here.

581
34:58.700 --> 34:59.700
Take your thing

582
35:00.470 --> 35:01.060
and get out!

583
35:06.460 --> 35:09.900
(Grand Princess Luling's Residence)

584
35:27.060 --> 35:27.910
Your Highness...

585
35:29.020 --> 35:30.470
What on earth did she do to you?

586
35:30.910 --> 35:31.700
You're still out of your mind.

587
35:34.950 --> 35:35.830
Your Highness...

588
35:37.470 --> 35:38.390
Look at me carefully.

589
35:39.390 --> 35:40.540
Which princess am I?

590
35:46.620 --> 35:47.950
I know.

591
35:49.350 --> 35:50.060
You're...

592
35:51.830 --> 35:52.500
Mu...

593
35:53.430 --> 35:53.950
Wan...

594
35:55.100 --> 35:55.660
yao.

595
36:00.350 --> 36:01.700
You're only this bold

596
36:02.660 --> 36:03.830
when you're out of your mind.

597
36:05.060 --> 36:05.750
Once you come to,

598
36:06.910 --> 36:07.750
how much will you remember?

599
36:15.180 --> 36:15.990
Don't move.

600
36:19.700 --> 36:20.449
What are you doing?

601
36:20.491 --> 36:21.161
Wanyao...

602
36:26.140 --> 36:31.330
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

603
36:31.780 --> 36:37.810
♪- Through trails of mud and blood - Let grief drown in your eyes♪

604
36:39.510 --> 36:43.000
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

605
36:43.050 --> 36:44.380
♪Burning bright as a song♪

606
36:44.580 --> 36:48.410
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

607
36:48.720 --> 36:53.090
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

608
36:54.140 --> 36:57.770
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

609
36:58.610 --> 37:00.800
♪Not a single hour less♪

610
37:00.850 --> 37:07.760
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

611
37:08.290 --> 37:11.730
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

612
37:11.930 --> 37:15.390
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

613
37:15.440 --> 37:22.440
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

614
37:22.660 --> 37:24.290
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

615
37:24.340 --> 37:25.189
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn - May time be free of pain♪

616
37:25.231 --> 37:25.819
Your Highness, what's wrong?

617
37:27.500 --> 37:28.540
♪You're the only one I need♪

618
37:28.540 --> 37:29.060
Nothing.

619
37:29.870 --> 37:30.324
Keep driving.

620
37:30.366 --> 37:37.197
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

621
37:37.239 --> 37:40.345
♪Be my one and only in this world; be my one and only in this life♪

622
37:40.800 --> 37:42.860
♪My last untouched innocence♪

623
37:47.660 --> 37:50.980
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

624
38:04.020 --> 38:04.990
Your Highness, we're here.

625
38:11.910 --> 38:12.270
Your Highness.

626
38:20.140 --> 38:21.159
Help me carry him down.

627
38:21.201 --> 38:21.851
I can't manage him alone.

628
38:22.990 --> 38:23.310
Got it.

629
38:25.080 --> 38:28.030
♪You're the only one I need♪

630
38:34.060 --> 38:35.270
Why is he lying on the ground?

631
38:35.870 --> 38:36.910
Her Highness could've warned me!

632
38:41.790 --> 38:43.470
Yan Shang, sit here for a moment.

633
38:44.870 --> 38:45.470
Thank you.

634
38:47.830 --> 38:48.790
So polite.

635
38:49.060 --> 38:49.950
You're barely conscious,

636
38:50.180 --> 38:51.220
yet you still remember your manners.

637
38:53.020 --> 38:53.870
A true scholar indeed.

638
39:22.660 --> 39:23.500
Don't push yourself.

639
39:23.950 --> 39:24.950
The physician will be here soon.

640
40:31.350 --> 40:33.140
Wh-what are you trying to do?

641
41:10.140 --> 41:10.580
Yan Shang!

642
41:37.430 --> 41:38.060
Your Highness.

643
41:39.500 --> 41:40.540
I'm sorry about earlier.

644
41:43.140 --> 41:43.500
You...

645
41:45.700 --> 41:46.580
You remember everything?

646
41:50.140 --> 41:50.700
I...

647
42:41.580 --> 42:42.500
When did you wake up?

648
42:43.620 --> 42:44.430
A little while ago.

649
42:46.540 --> 42:47.270
Why didn't you say anything?

650
42:48.830 --> 42:49.870
I was afraid you'd throw me out again

651
42:50.660 --> 42:51.950
if I spoke,

652
42:53.020 --> 42:53.990
just like last time.

653
42:57.580 --> 42:58.500
You were lucky this time.

654
43:00.100 --> 43:01.910
You're injured and caught a chill.

655
43:03.100 --> 43:04.430
Heartless as I am,

656
43:04.830 --> 43:06.220
I wouldn't throw you out tonight.

657
43:08.350 --> 43:09.100
Get some rest.

658
43:11.910 --> 43:12.470
Your Highness.

659
43:13.790 --> 43:14.470
Why?

660
43:15.350 --> 43:16.100
Why what?

661
43:16.910 --> 43:19.100
Why did you go alone to the Grand Princess's

662
43:19.390 --> 43:20.220
and provoke her?

663
43:21.790 --> 43:23.310
She's the last person in Sheng'an

664
43:23.830 --> 43:25.270
you should offend.

665
43:25.470 --> 43:26.310
You have the nerve to say that?

666
43:27.430 --> 43:28.060
If I hadn't come,

667
43:28.790 --> 43:30.540
she would've devoured you alive.

668
43:30.750 --> 43:31.470
So what?

669
43:31.990 --> 43:32.830
What do you mean?

670
43:37.500 --> 43:38.830
Are you in your right mind?

671
43:41.750 --> 43:43.310
So what if I couldn't escape

672
43:44.350 --> 43:45.100
the Grand Princess?

673
43:46.580 --> 43:48.750
Why risk your life to save me?

674
43:50.620 --> 43:51.060
Yan Shang,

675
43:52.180 --> 43:53.430
don't think that being injured

676
43:54.350 --> 43:55.500
will stop me from throwing you out.

677
43:56.750 --> 43:58.430
Because Your Highness feels about me

678
43:59.620 --> 44:01.220
exactly as I feel

679
44:03.620 --> 44:04.470
about Your Highness.

680
44:18.910 --> 44:19.430
Your Highness,

681
44:21.430 --> 44:22.500
at the banquet that day,

682
44:24.140 --> 44:25.180
I wanted to tell you...

683
44:25.580 --> 44:25.990
Yan Shang.

684
44:28.140 --> 44:28.750
Don't say it.

685
44:37.910 --> 44:38.830
What happened tonight,

686
44:40.620 --> 44:41.350
and whatever lies between us,

687
44:43.910 --> 44:44.620
ends here.

688
44:47.620 --> 44:48.500
There are too many things

689
44:50.100 --> 44:51.470
left unfinished in Sheng'an.

690
44:53.950 --> 44:54.790
Even if I achieve everything

691
44:56.060 --> 44:56.830
I've set out to do one day,

692
44:58.830 --> 44:59.470
I'll never

693
45:01.310 --> 45:02.910
form a bond with anyone

694
45:03.910 --> 45:04.390
or marry.

695
45:11.870 --> 45:12.540
I'll say this

696
45:13.950 --> 45:14.830
only once.

697
45:18.020 --> 45:18.950
Don't bring it up again.

698
45:21.700 --> 45:22.310
Why?

699
45:37.260 --> 45:41.860
(Next Episode Preview)

700
45:42.540 --> 45:43.870
Everyone in Sheng'an knows

701
45:43.950 --> 45:45.790
how talented you are, Mr. Wei.

702
45:46.220 --> 45:46.910
You...

703
45:47.180 --> 45:48.310
you're not wed yet, are you?

704
45:48.830 --> 45:49.500
Your Highness,

705
45:49.950 --> 45:50.540
what is it?

706
45:50.700 --> 45:52.310
The most sought-after young man of the Wei family

707
45:53.060 --> 45:53.990
is none other than you.

708
45:54.700 --> 45:56.700
And you're much more to my taste.

709
45:58.840 --> 46:02.133
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

710
46:04.818 --> 46:09.734
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

711
46:11.928 --> 46:17.773
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

712
46:18.273 --> 46:23.499
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

713
46:26.268 --> 46:31.059
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

714
46:31.895 --> 46:37.974
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

715
46:39.775 --> 46:42.925
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

716
46:42.925 --> 46:44.573
♪Burning bright as a song♪

717
46:44.625 --> 46:48.349
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

718
46:48.727 --> 46:53.393
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

719
46:54.012 --> 46:58.053
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

720
46:58.544 --> 47:00.659
♪Not a single hour less♪

721
47:00.699 --> 47:07.645
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

722
47:08.408 --> 47:11.861
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

723
47:12.041 --> 47:15.186
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

724
47:15.625 --> 47:22.262
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

725
47:22.659 --> 47:24.697
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

726
47:24.697 --> 47:27.173
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

727
47:27.211 --> 47:29.680
♪You're the only one I need♪

728
47:29.884 --> 47:36.771
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

729
47:37.083 --> 47:40.354
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

730
47:40.659 --> 47:43.832
♪My last untouched innocence♪

731
47:44.156 --> 47:47.582
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

732
47:47.815 --> 47:51.040
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

733
47:51.371 --> 47:58.167
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

734
47:58.536 --> 48:00.598
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

735
48:00.599 --> 48:03.102
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

736
48:03.149 --> 48:05.487
♪You're the only one I need♪

737
48:05.718 --> 48:12.553
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

738
48:12.902 --> 48:14.520
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

739
48:14.650 --> 48:16.446
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

740
48:16.803 --> 48:19.820
♪You're the only one I need♪

741
48:19.860 --> 48:21.187
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
